verb egg_fall_boss_timer_clears "Gohma's egg bounces and wobbles before hatching is over" by world priority 100 in enemy at 2180 220
  take timer_egg_fall_boss
  unless phase_egg_fall_boss

verb hatch_timer_clears "Larva breaks out of its shell is over" by world priority 100 in enemy at 2040 360
  take timer_hatch
  unless phase_hatch

verb stand_timer_clears "Larva stands and watches Link is over" by world priority 100 in enemy at 2180 430
  take timer_stand
