verb prepare_jump_timer_clears "Larva crouches to leap is over" by world priority 100 in enemy at 2180 570
  take timer_prepare_jump
  unless phase_prepare_jump

verb land_timer_clears "Larva lands is over" by world priority 100 in enemy at 2180 710
  take timer_land
  unless phase_land

verb hurt_timer_clears "Larva reels from a hit is over" by world priority 100 in enemy at 2040 850
